# Locked hardware

- ESP32-DevKitC-32E, PMS5003, SCD41, BME688, MQ135, SX1278 @ 433 MHz, Raspberry Pi 5.
- No GPS/GNSS: no UART, PPS, parser, packet fields, runtime dependency.
- No 868/915 MHz. Wi-Fi/BLE are not the field telemetry path.
- Pins live only in BSP (`HW-NODE-r2`, ADR-013): I²C 21/22, PMS 16/17, LoRa SPI 18/23/19 CS5 RST14 DIO0 25, MQ135 ADC 34, LED 2.
- GPIO34 is MQ135 only. Battery ADC is `AEIOS_BSP_PIN_UNASSIGNED` until a second channel is validated. Do not hide electrical conflicts.
- MQ135 divider ratio is configuration. Conditioned analog only.
- Configurable node identity; do not hard-code five nodes.

This rule does not override a controlled document.
